# 03 — Phase End & Hand-off

<!-- GEN: Why: the full suite, a self bug-hunt, a simplicity pass and evidence on one exact revision are what stop a red or out-of-scope phase from being handed off. Kind: Mandatory — keep the purpose, adapt the structure (core/authoring-guide.md). -->

