## 4. Revisions

- Review inspects the handed-off revision; verification uses the **reviewed** revision.
- Any fix creates a new revision and restarts the affected review, tests and visual checks.
- The approved plan stays unchanged; actual results go to `{{results_file}}` (written by {{results_owner}}).

